{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やぁ！\nヽ(・∀・)ノ\n生駒ちゃんだよ！\nこのブログは新しく変えた携帯から投稿しているよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと出来たかしら〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でゅひっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてっ！\n四月生まれのひめたんっ！まあやちゃんお誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/04/24/7444625/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/04/24/7444625/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/04/24/7444625/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/04/24/7444625/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/04/24/7444625/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/04/24/7444625/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/04/24/7444625/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは17歳だね〜\n生駒ちゃんと同い年だねっ！\nまぁ年下だけどね〜(*ﾉ∀ﾉ)\nひめたんびーむをもっと強くしていこうねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやちゃん！15歳だね〜\n15歳はいこまちゃんが上京した時と同じだよ！\nあんた‥偉いね〜\nなんか不安な事とかあったら、言ってね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/04/24/7444625/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うほープリンシパル！\nがんばるぞっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/04/24/7444625/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画像もちゃんと貼れたかしら(ﾉ・Д・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}